    "description": "<p>Make a <strong>Spellcast Roll (10).</strong> On a success, you can spend a Hope to create a visible wall of writhing necrotic energy between two points within Far range. The wall lasts until you mark a Hit Point or cast this spell again. A creature inside the wall when it appears or that passes through it must mark 2 Stress.</p>",
